text-church-blue uppercase tracking-[4px] text-xs block mb-3\",\"children\":\"Biography\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-4xl text-church-dark font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":[\"ስለ ፓስተሩ \",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl text-[#9a8a80] font-normal\",\"children\":\"/ About the Pastor\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-church-blue to-gold mb-8\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-5 font-body text-[#5a4a40] text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Pastor Beza Taye Merne was born and raised in Eastern Ethiopia. He completed his secondary education in the city of Dire Dawa and earned a Bachelor's Degree in Theology from the Meserete Kristos Church Seminary in Bishoftu (formerly Debre Zeit), Ethiopia.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For sixteen years, Pastor Beza faithfully served as a pastor and church planter among Meserete Kristos churches throughout Eastern Ethiopia, dedicating his life to evangelism, discipleship, and church growth. In 2019, following God's calling and the leading of the Holy Spirit, he and his wife, Yetnait Weldegiorgis, relocated to Alexandria, Virginia. Together, they founded Christ Saints' Church, where Pastor Beza continues to serve as the founding pastor and spiritual leader.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Pastor Beza is a devoted husband and loving father. He is deeply committed to sharing the Gospel of Jesus Christ, equipping believers for spiritual growth, and serving people with compassion and humility. His greatest joy is seeing lives transformed by Christ, witnessing individuals come to faith, and helping them grow into mature disciples who faithfully follow Jesus. Through his ministry, he strives to glorify God and inspire others to live with faith, hope, and purpose in Christ.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-5 font-body text-[#5a4a40] text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"ፓስተር ቤዛ ታዬ  መርኔ በምስራቅ ኢትዮጵያ ተወልደው እና አድገዋል። የሁለተኛ ደረጃ ትምህርታቸውን በድሬዳዋ ከተማ አጠናቀው፣ ከመሰረተ ክርስቶስ ቤተ ክርስቲያን ሴሚናሪ (ቢሾፍቱ/ደብረ ዘይት) በሥነ መለኮት (Theology) የባችለር ዲግሪ አግኝተዋል።\"}],\"$L3\",\"$L4\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]}],\"$L5\"],null,\"$L6\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"zDkPnmm3pF23g63BiZfRh\"}\n3:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"ፓስተር ቤዛ በምስራቅ ኢትዮጵያ በሚገኙ የመሰረተ ክርስቶስ አብያተ ክርስቲያናት ውስጥ ለ16 ዓመታት በታማኝነት እንደ ፓስተርና አዲስ ቤተ ክርስቲያን ተክላይ (Church Planter) አገልግለዋል። በ2019 ዓ.ም. በእግዚአብሔር ጥሪና በመንፈስ ቅዱስ ምሪት፣ ከባለቤታቸው ከወ/ሮ የትናይት ወልደ ጊዮርጊስ ጋር ወደ አሌክሳንድሪያ፣ ቨርጂኒያ ተዛውረዋል። የክርስቶስ መሠረት ቤተክርስቲያንን  መስርተው እስከ ዛሬ ድረስ እንደ መሥራች እና ዋና ፓስተር በትጋት እያገለገሉ ይገኛሉ።\"}]\n4:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"ፓስተር ቤዛ  ታማኝ ባልና የቤተሰብ ኃላፊ ናቸው። ወንጌልን በታማኝነት ለማወጅ፣ አማኞችን በእምነታቸው ለማሳደግ እና ሰዎችን በፍቅርና በትሕትና ለማገልገል በጥልቅ የተሰጡ ናቸው። ሰዎች ክርስቶስን እንዲያውቁ፣ ሕይወታቸው በእርሱ እንዲለወጥ እና የኢየሱስ ክርስቶስ ደቀ መዛሙርት ሆነው እንዲያድጉ ማየት ታላቅ ደስታቸው ነው። በአገልግሎታቸው ሁሉ እግዚአብሔርን ለማክበር እና ሌሎችን በእምነት፣ በተስፋ እና በክርስቶስ ዓላማ የተሞላ ሕይወት እንዲኖሩ ለማነሳሳት ይተጋሉ።\"}]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"py-20 px-6 bg-cream\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-accent text-church-blue uppercase tracking-[4px] text-xs block mb-4\",\"children\":\"Message from the Pastor\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-4xl text-church-dark font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"A Word from the Pastor\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-12 h-0.5 bg-gold mx-auto mb-8\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white p-10 border border-gold/20 shadow-md relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-4 left-6 text-8xl font-serif text-gold/10 leading-none select-none\",\"children\":\"“\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-[#5a4a40] leading-relaxed text-sm relative z-10 mb-4\",\"childre